T:Down in the Swamp
L:1/8
M:C|
C:© 1988 Bela Fleck, arr. © 2005 Ben Paley
N:Transcribed from memory. I initially learnt it off Bela Fleck's album "Drive", but I've played
N:it a lot since then and may have messed around with it a little. I recorded it with the Wild
N:Turkey Brothers on our album "Like This Only Better" back in 1992, and you can listen to the
N:track or download the album for free at benpaley.com/resources/audio/wild-turkey-brothers/ —
N:and, of course, you should definitely listen to Bela Fleck playing it on his Bandcamp page:
N:belafleck.bandcamp.com/album/drive
